sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant G as Guardian
    participant M as Model/Planner
    participant T as Trust Kernel
    participant V as Credential Vault
    participant X as External Tool
    participant A as Audit Log

    U->>G: Request action
    G->>M: Interpret + plan
    M->>T: Proposed action + declared purpose
    T->>T: Identity + permission + risk checks

    alt approval required
        T->>G: Explain action + request approval
        G->>U: What / data / destination / reversibility / reason
        U->>G: Approve
        G->>T: Signed approval
    end

    T->>V: Request scoped capability token
    V-->>T: Short-lived token
    T->>X: Execute authorized action
    X-->>T: Result
    T->>A: Append decision + execution record
    T-->>G: Verified result
    G-->>U: Report outcome
